		"Party results: the UPN won Lagos, Ogun, Oyo, Ondo and Bendel; the NPP Anambra, Imo and Plateau; the PRP Kano and Kaduna; the GNPP Borno and Gongola; the NPN the other seven. The 1983 results were widely disputed.",
		"worldstatesmen lists Jakande and Cornelius Adebayo as NPN; their Wikipedia biographies say UPN, which is followed here. It also lists Omoboriowo as Ondo governor, but the Court of Appeal reinstated Ajasin before he took office."
